      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6791
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "That k is a leftover: old talk stuck in every knee, knot and knuckle.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_078/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7079,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7627
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "A knee to kneel on. A knife to cut with. A knock at the door. A knot in a lace. A knob to pull!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_078/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 9299,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9900
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Knight is the champ: its k says nothing and its gh says nothing as well!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_078/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_078/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6295,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
